      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start but I noticed the coverage score is still pretty low. my supervisor is really strict about seeing as many of those names as possible to prove I've done the reading. \n\nthe current draft only hits a few of them. can you expand this into a much more detailed and comprehensive review? try to weave in as many of the other names from that list as you can so we can get that coverage score way up. just make sure it still sounds like an academic paper.",
